    "body": "@tynguyen2k1 I might be misunderstanding the issue. Is it that you'd expect the package module (📦 ) and the Docker symbol module (🐳) to be shown in this project?\r\n\r\nIf so, the section:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[package]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```\r\n\r\nWill hide the package module from showing in the prompt as you say in your comment, so if you want to show it you should remove this section or explicitly set `disabled = false`",
