    "created_at": "2021-10-29T11:47:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-10-29T11:47:39Z",
    "body": "It looks like versions in `docker_compose.yml` are limited to versions of the file format and not package versions, so I am not convinced that it's appropriate for the `package` module. \r\nThere is an existing `docker_context` module, but that's only related to the active docker context. You can follow #393 for progress on a specific docker (compose) module.\r\nTo show a docker symbol, you can use a custom module until a module is added:\r\n```toml\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n[custom.docker]\r\nfiles = [\"docker-compose.yml\"]\r\nsymbol = \"🐋\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
